 976:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         HAL_ADC_Stop_DMA() must be called after this function with handle of
 977:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         ADC slave, to properly disable the DMA channel.
