1619:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****       (+) Enter ADC deep-power-down mode
1620:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c **** 
1621:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c **** @endverbatim
