2102:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @note   Possibility to update parameters on the fly:
2103:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         This function initializes multimode parameters, following
2104:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         calls to this function can be used to reconfigure some parameters
2105:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         of structure "ADC_MultiModeTypeDef" on the fly, without resetting
